cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit in preparing academic work, please cite it as follows."
title: "PaperForge — Ideal Chemistry Academic Writing (v2)"
abstract: >-
  PaperForge: a chemistry-aware manuscript engine that turns structured data,
  figures and verified references into a submission-ready manuscript, scoring it
  against 90 machine-readable rules and 261 journal profiles built from 1,616
  publications of the IISER Bhopal Department of Chemistry. Includes LaTeX/Word/
  Markdown templates, a journal matcher, reference verification (Crossref,
  retractions), structure/TOC drawing, and submission packaging.
keywords:
  - academic writing
  - chemistry
  - LaTeX templates
  - thesis template
  - peer review
  - research methodology
  - publishing
  - IISER Bhopal
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-10-19"
version: "2.1.0"
authors:
  - name: "Arpit Singh"
    affiliation: "Department of Chemistry, IISER Bhopal"
